# Retimed for the native single fade owner (8179ccd80) from soz1-cold-knuckles.bk2 (double-advance harness).
# Bonus entry: frozen window 3191 is 21 native frames; the old harness spent 10 inputs there (old load row 3201), so 11 held inputs are inserted
# (FadeWindowRetimeTool ceil(21/2) inserts only 10 for this phase). Bonus exit: the player-frozen fade runs with live VInt, so the tool does not
# treat it as frozen; the old return row 3559 lands at native 3581, so the held L run before it gains 11 inputs.
# Retimed for the Level-routine title-card hold (titlecard-r2 lane, base d3fb0625e): the bonus entry card releases BONUS_STAGE at its loc_64DC hold 5 frames earlier (old locked window 3215-3321, now 102 frames) and the bonus return card 64 frames earlier (old window 3588-3712, now 61 frames), so 5 neutral inputs before the entry release (3312-3316) and the return window's first 64 inputs (3588-3651, never read while locked) are removed; the held L / R at each release keep their edge history.
